#: includes/pro__premium_only/workflow/class-review.php:430
msgid "This review link is not valid any more. Ask for a new one."
msgstr "ລິ້ງການກວດສອບນີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ກະລຸນາຂໍອັນໃໝ່."

